=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nSeveral picker and chooser handlers invoke mCallback and null the member\nafterwards. Move the callback into a local before invoking it, and return\nearly when it is already null, so each handler runs at most once.\n\nHandlers updated:\n  * widget/nsFilePickerProxy.cpp (Recv__delete__, ActorDestroy)\n  * widget/gtk/nsFilePicker.cpp (DoneNonPortal, DonePortal, DoneCommon)\n  * widget/gtk/nsColorPicker.cpp (Done)\n  * widget/gtk/nsApplicationChooser.cpp (Done)\n  * widget/cocoa/nsColorPicker.mm (Done)\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D309753\n\n(cherry picked from commit 9218e63542cccf76054284d84f95c07f1b0b4332)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326719\n", "files": ["widget/cocoa/nsColorPicker.mm", "widget/gtk/nsApplicationChooser.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsColorPicker.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsFilePicker.cpp", "widget/nsFilePickerProxy.cpp"], "git_node": "2a625c48d9c07233d480193e170ff4e1cf076a00", "git_parents": ["a7e2d06dcba57554d2b7f31a9e11b27a6d35d3ed"], "node": "7437e8275d0a485585f0aca91ca6a4291d20e441", "parents": ["0b238b51b52d6343c5e9e625d439f30150f3d30e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789661702, "git_changesets": ["2a625c48d9c07233d480193e170ff4e1cf076a00"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1689": {"changesets": [{"author": "Tomislav Jovanovic \u003ctomica@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057988 - Reject a duplicate conduit id.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325089\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326715\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/extensions/ConduitsParent.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/extensions/test/mochitest/test_ext_subframes_privileges.html"], "git_node": "45f007c8b7b0ea4df8c04df1b08081033e933271", "git_parents": ["2a625c48d9c07233d480193e170ff4e1cf076a00"], "node": "f5ccd3502cf1669416256c86ffb1e15fc3fb2a8a", "parents": ["7437e8275d0a485585f0aca91ca6a4291d20e441"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789661739, "git_changesets": ["45f007c8b7b0ea4df8c04df1b08081033e933271"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1690": {"changesets": [{"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2047721 - Clear VP9 frame-thread state on flush  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nCherry-pick of FFmpeg commit a024f8c5413d (avcodec/vp9: unref next_refs in\nvp9_decode_flush). vp9_decode_flush() releases s-\u003es.refs[] but not\ns-\u003enext_refs[], and vp9_decode_update_thread_context() seeds a worker's\nrefs[] from the source worker's next_refs[], so references from before a\nflush could survive it. Unref next_refs[] alongside refs[].\n\nThe commit is not in the FFmpeg 9.0 release branch, so it is carried as\nvp9-flush-unref-next-refs.patch and listed in README_MOZILLA to be\nre-applied on the next ffvpx update.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310961\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326602\n", "files": ["media/ffvpx/README_MOZILLA", "media/ffvpx/libavcodec/vp9.c", "media/ffvpx/vp9-flush-unref-next-refs.patch"], "git_node": "eabeeb4eab85b74edd82681291d012695990aff6", "git_parents": ["45f007c8b7b0ea4df8c04df1b08081033e933271"], "node": "67f5fa9ceb8a8df1a3e3193b438ae5f4f5269674", "parents": ["f5ccd3502cf1669416256c86ffb1e15fc3fb2a8a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789661786, "git_changesets": ["eabeeb4eab85b74edd82681291d012695990aff6"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1691": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068346 - Unwrap a copy in GetJSValFromKeyPathString.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326021\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326477\n", "files": ["dom/indexedDB/KeyPath.cpp"], "git_node": "383f3cd2e0723da8142c22e6a2eed4d1b5b04609", "git_parents": ["eabeeb4eab85b74edd82681291d012695990aff6"], "node": 