406 - Validate the display directory for file picker;  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325830\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326917\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/FilePickerParent.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsFilePicker.cpp", "widget/nsBaseFilePicker.cpp", "widget/nsBaseFilePicker.h"], "git_node": "ffca477bc5efd4932ed49abafd2d51d7f2c6a7fd", "git_parents": ["18e981373dde9e315b63e52fdb9b3c2be761b5b8"], "node": "527fcd7019354a445f18d995953dd8fd76cd9d39", "parents": ["a83312570904353d05024d2837c40a178e9315fb"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789747000, "git_changesets": ["ffca477bc5efd4932ed49abafd2d51d7f2c6a7fd"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1700": {"changesets": [{"author": "canalun \u003ci.am.kanaru.sato@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071784 - Add guid check to RecvSetTargetAPZC.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326281\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326983\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/ipc/APZCTreeManagerParent.cpp"], "git_node": "0e6f1ba457be3c0e76d85296805e1de21b3498b3", "git_parents": ["ffca477bc5efd4932ed49abafd2d51d7f2c6a7fd"], "node": "9a2f7bd1363c7a627b3749df4e86c9444ab196c0", "parents": ["527fcd7019354a445f18d995953dd8fd76cd9d39"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789747037, "git_changesets": ["0e6f1ba457be3c0e76d85296805e1de21b3498b3"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1701": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059404 - Use weak references in sLayerToBrowserParentTable and unregister in ~BrowserParent.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nUsing weak references in sLayerToBrowserParentTable ensures that we never end\nup with dangling pointers. Clean up the table in ~BrowserParent() in case we\nskipped ActorDestroy.\n\nGetBrowserParentFromLayersId now returns an already_AddRefed because we were\nholding onto a strong reference anyways, and it is probably better anyways to\nhold strong stack references in the callers.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323315\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326777\n", "files": ["dom/events/EventStateManager.cpp", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.h", "gfx/layers/apz/util/APZCCallbackHelper.cpp", "toolkit/components/contentanalysis/ContentAnalysis.cpp"], "git_node": "983701a3042726bce0c329a96160560a339c3976", "git_parents": ["0e6f1ba457be3c0e76d85296805e1de21b3498b3"], "node": "a704d2d9c006a9505d2d656592f349310c8a1699", "parents": ["9a2f7bd1363c7a627b3749df4e86c9444ab196c0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059404 - Reject child-initiated deletion.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nThe child should only send us the delete message after we've sent it the\nDestroy message, so if that's not the case, something has gone wrong, so\nlet's kill the child process to prevent further hijinks.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323316\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326778\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/BrowserParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.h"], "git_node": "371c264dfc26afc4750d1a5cf1645620ee5e931c", "git_parents": ["983701a3042726bce0c329a96160560a339c3976"], "node": "aa0b035b7b5a87ec7b35aad4f65b83e0416d8d54", "parents": ["a704d2d9c006a9505d2d656592f349310c8a1699"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059404 - Don't initialize rendering for an already-destroyed BrowserParent.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nIf we can't send in nsFrameLoader::TryRemoteBrowserInternal() or\nBrowserParent::InitRendering(), then we've already started the process of\ndestroying the BrowserParent, so don't set up this rendering stuff that we may\nhave already tried to clean up.\n\nNote that mIsDestroyed is not usable here: it is only set by BrowserParent::Destroy(),\nwhich is not involved when the child initiates teardown.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323317\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326779\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsFrameLoader.cpp", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.cpp"], "git_node": "247216f8f07f645a8c6eb5b1e2d724bc8849d760", "git_parents": ["371c264dfc26afc4750d1a5cf1645620ee5e931c"], "node": "68a96b439dd0b76c02041986e6c3e8a8ff845b0e", "parents": ["aa0b035b7b5a87ec7b35aad4f65b83e0416d8d54"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789802185, "git_changesets": ["983701a3042726bce0c329a96160560a339c3976", "371c264dfc26afc4750d1a5cf1645620ee5e931c", "247216f8f07f645a8c6eb5b1e2d724bc8849d760"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1702": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068456.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326370\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327018\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxOTSUtils.h"], "git_node": "82df1461642cb50fa1e2bf778f8b4adc245ba55d", "git_parents": ["247216f8f07f645a8c6eb5b1e2d724bc8849d760"], "node": "7135cb541fc4fc8558c647594328e6471f3fe528", "parents": ["68a96b439dd0b76c02041986e6c3e8a8ff845b0e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789802207, "git_changesets": ["82df1461642cb50fa1e2bf778f8b4adc245ba55d"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1703": {"changesets": [{"author": "Kui-Feng Lee \u003cthinker.li@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069399 - Hold references to the print dialog's header/footer dropdowns.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324694\n\n(cherry picked from commit 99645b958a738e515f8dbb305dbf9ff2ada6e438)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327039\n", "files": ["widget/gtk/nsPrintDialogGTK.cpp"], "git_node": "92962ba7e925b7c7e478c28d9382ac88cb4ad0f8", "git_parents": ["82df1461642cb50fa1e2bf778f8b4adc245ba55d"], "node": "fa1ec5d210108d042bd9ece546c3e695d4d016b4", "parents": ["7135cb541fc4fc8558c647594328e6471f3fe528"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789802270, "git_changesets": ["92962ba7e925b7c7e478c28d9382ac88cb4ad0f8"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1704": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068322 - Make BrowserParent::mBrowserHost a strong reference.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324465\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327065\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/BrowserParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.h"], "git_node": "077b644a65fc2cb757d3a2387124bbc40e915e59", "git_parents": ["92962ba7e925b7c7e478c28d9382ac88cb4ad0f8"], "node": "b6fca82e828653c201ac8c819d02465309e1c157", "parents": ["fa1ec5d210108d042bd9ece546c3e695d4d016b4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068322 - Make BrowserParent::mBrowserBridgeParent a WeakPtr.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nEvery user of the field runs on the parent process main thread, which\nWeakPtr's debug-only owning-thread assertions now enforce.\nBrowserBridgeParent::Destroy() still clears it explicitly, so the pointer\nis dropped when the actor is destroyed rather than when the\nBrowserBridgeParent is freed.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324466\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327066\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/BrowserBridgeParent.h", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.h"], "git_node": "bceff4b2d7aa42acce992e7fe1dcf56cb59c41cd", "git_parents": ["077b644a65fc2cb757d3a2387124bbc40e915e59"], "node": "e46892855585f402a24b95632853ec2ec74f5bda", "parents": ["b6fca82e828653c201ac8c819d02465309e1c157"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068322 - Don't let a content process name an already-embedded tab as the new tab in CreateWindow.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nIn TryRemoteBrowserInternal, don't create a new BrowserHost is we're going to\nfail immediately anyways. This could result in failing to clean up properly.\n\nFor the two BrowserParent set methods, check in release builds that we are\neither clearing the field or the BrowserParent is not already in use.\n\nIn ContentParent::RecvCreateWindow, make sure that the child is handing us a\nfresh BrowserParent, or we can get into a weird state because things aren't\ncleaned up properly.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324467\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327067\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsFrameLoader.cpp", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.h", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp"], "git_node": "c1cf87223ba93217c3693f33d4ee56e9a50bbdf8", "git_parents": ["bceff4b2d7aa42acce992e7fe1dcf56cb59c41cd"], "node": "5ee3b97bc3781f506ce694a33658fa357d85af4a", "parents": ["e46892855585f402a24b95632853ec2ec74f5bda"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068322 - Wait to set BrowserParent::mBrowserBridgeParent.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nDon't set BrowserParent::mBrowserBridgeParent until we've set the strong half of\nthe cycle, BrowserBridgeParent::mBrowserParent, in case we hit any failure states.\n\nBrowserParent::mBrowserBridgeParent is now only set alongside the strong\nBrowserBridgeParent::mBrowserParent reference, and the two are cleared together,\nso Destroy() can only ever be clearing its own back pointer. Assert that, so\nthis doesn't silently regress into clobbering another bridge's pointer.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324468\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327068\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/BrowserBridgeParent.cpp"], "git_node": "ec598bf8962054f36d64b40dd23e9c1072bff8b2", "git_parents": ["c1cf87223ba93217c3693f33d4ee56e9a50bbdf8"], "node": "178ee7e4da91527a83eeb8d993c1f5776eb96a45", "parents": ["5ee3b97bc3781f506ce694a33658fa357d85af4a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068322 - Don't embed a discarded BrowsingContext from RecvCreateWindow.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nThis is like a semi-related cleanup found while working on the other patches.\n\nThe existing BrowsingContext validation checks the shape of the new tab's\nBrowsingContext but not whether it is still live, so a discarded one would be\nadopted as the new frameloader's pending BrowsingContext by CreateBrowsingContext\nin nsFrameLoader.cpp and then embedded.\n\nUnlike the other checks here this isn't necessarily the child's fault, so fail\nthe window open the way we already do for a missing parent rather than killing\nthe child.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324469\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327069\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp"], "git_node": "b2d09f4989f8a3c5d5ca111601d06206ed5bea6b", "git_parents": ["ec598bf8962054f36d64b40dd23e9c1072bff8b2"], "node": "82a8d375526edfeaa7fe9923e27003130e92927f", "parents": ["178ee7e4da91527a83eeb8d993c1f5776eb96a45"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789802409, "git_changesets": ["077b644a65fc2cb757d3a2387124bbc40e915e59", "bceff4b2d7aa42acce992e7fe1dcf56cb59c41cd", "c1cf87223ba93217c3693f33d4ee56e9a50bbdf8", "ec598bf8962054f36d64b40dd23e9c1072bff8b2", "b2d09f4989f8a3c5d5ca111601d06206ed5bea6b"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1705": {"changesets": [{"author": "Leo Tenenbaum \u003cltenenbaum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072432 - Use AppendChild instead of AppendChildTo in txMozillaXMLOutput.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326562\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327119\n", "files": ["dom/xslt/xslt/txMozillaXMLOutput.cpp"], "git_node": "b1373f6d852fb8b9d83f8fc94226a1fdaf77032b", "git_parents": ["b2d09f4989f8a3c5d5ca111601d06206ed5bea6b"], "node": "5e3a51dc5a0a2cd443e98c861875b04460febd02", "parents": ["82a8d375526edfeaa7fe9923e27003130e92927f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789802445, "git_changesets": ["b1373f6d852fb8b9d83f8fc94226a1fdaf77032b"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1706": {"changesets": [{"author": "Yannis Juglaret \u003cyjuglaret@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070478 - Fix macOS exception handling for child processes that don't register their own exception handler.  a=pascalc\n\nWhen we receive an exception that is not meant for us, we claim we\nwant to ignore the exception. However, what we actually tell the\nkernel is that we handled the exception and it can resume the thread\nthat crashed. This causes a crash loop where the process gets\ncontinually resumed at the crashing point, generating a new\nexception and then getting resumed again. It never gets terminated\nby the kernel.\n\nFix that by telling the kernel we didn't handle the exception, so\nthat the exception continues to propagate and the process crashes.\n\nDiscovered while writing tests where the updater binary crashes as\na child of xpcshell. The updater binary does not register an\nexception handler. The tests were failing with a timeout.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324566\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327357\n", "files": ["toolkit/crashreporter/breakpad-client/mac/handler/exception_handler.cc", "toolkit/crashreporter/test/gtest/TestMacExceptionHandler.cpp", "toolkit/crashreporter/test/gtest/moz.build"], "git_node": "2ce10645e871d5d5e742872198fd446ea55bf40a", "git_parents": ["b1373f6d852fb8b9d83f8fc94226a1fdaf77032b"], "node": "512189726d96cd56e093af5682bf0dbaefd619df", "parents": ["5e3a51dc5a0a2cd443e98c861875b04460febd02"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789802503, "git_changesets": ["2ce10645e871d5d5e742872198fd446ea55bf40a"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1707": {"changesets": [{"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071645.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326209\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327365\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarInput.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/browser_dragdropURL.js", "toolkit/components/places/BookmarkHTMLUtils.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/places/PlacesUtils.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "f5db1f83f4ebb575080a333a27d743088c9f3404", "git_parents": ["2ce10645e871d5d5e742872198fd446ea55bf40a"], "node": "6ac0e866c6ed1f38ff4fabf3b1e7eff24a23a08f", "parents": ["512189726d96cd56e093af5682bf0dbaefd619df"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789981790, "git_changesets": ["f5db1f83f4ebb575080a333a27d743088c9f3404"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1708": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr140 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes ct-logs -  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327782\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters/addons-mlbf.bin", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters/addons-mlbf.bin.meta.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters/softblocks-addons-mlbf.bin", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters/softblocks-addons-mlbf.bin.meta.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/devtools-compatibility-browsers.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/top-sites.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": "9015e67285447f5a2f24785318a00b853b6644d4", "git_parents": ["f5db1f83f4ebb575080a333a27d743088c9f3404"], "node": "4075941ebf9e9c9c898e5314820d03fc8a5f1806", "parents": ["6ac0e866c6ed1f38ff4fabf3b1e7eff24a23a08f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789990108, "git_changesets": ["9015e67285447f5a2f24785318a00b853b6644d4"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1709": {"changesets": [{"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067465.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326584\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327505\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/reputationservice/ApplicationReputation.cpp", "toolkit/components/reputationservice/test/gtest/TestExecutableLists.cpp", "xpcom/io/nsLocalFileCommon.cpp", "xpcom/io/nsLocalFileCommon.h"], "git_node": "d31f56926450d9e3d26119464e8972ffc162707e", "git_parents": ["9015e67285447f5a2f24785318a00b853b6644d4"], "node": "a10386248d59fd0c13e34466be718102beef97fb", "parents": ["4075941ebf9e9c9c898e5314820d03fc8a5f1806"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789991618, "git_changesets": ["d31f56926450d9e3d26119464e8972ffc162707e"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1710": {"changesets": [{"author": "longsonr \u003clongsonr@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072429  a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327600\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/CanvasRenderingContext2D.cpp", "dom/canvas/CanvasRenderingContext2D.h", "layout/svg/SVGObserverUtils.cpp", "layout/svg/SVGObserverUtils.h"], "git_node": "ab76ac1e0acd1f6a725d9a073c2c18009aea0d4c", "git_parents": ["d31f56926450d9e3d26119464e8972ffc162707e"], "node": "ff9554596ce4e2fa6e4adccba9bd0d6ff1193e75", "parents": ["a10386248d59fd0c13e34466be718102beef97fb"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789991799, "git_changesets": ["ab76ac1e0acd1f6a725d9a073c2c18009aea0d4c"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1711": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063680 - Destroy CacheIndexRecordWrapper via its refcount  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327035\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327703\n", "files": ["netwerk/cache2/CacheIndex.cpp", "netwerk/cache2/CacheIndex.h"], "git_node": "57991625878ab4fe9a7f20f6dc8337f3c36383f9", "git_parents": ["ab76ac1e0acd1f6a725d9a073c2c18009aea0d4c"], "node": "6bfab2d60692f1064f01fb55821af039596f15af", "parents": ["ff9554596ce4e2fa6e4adccba9bd0d6ff1193e75"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790015543, "git_changesets": ["57991625878ab4fe9a7f20f6dc8337f3c36383f9"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1712": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072467.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327500\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327695\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/OffscreenCanvas.cpp"], "git_node": "af7734e70983100702e4bb09a93a3c26caac4882", "git_parents": ["57991625878ab4fe9a7f20f6dc8337f3c36383f9"], "node": "727e88106bf51b5e9d034ee72d4e21912fc0aa28", "parents": ["6bfab2d60692f1064f01fb55821af039596f15af"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790019203, "git_changesets": ["af7734e70983100702e4bb09a93a3c26caac4882"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1713": {"changesets": [{"author": "Olli Pettay \u003cOlli.Pettay@helsinki.fi\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072433, don't leak elements with animated classes, a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326773\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327424\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsContentList.cpp", "dom/base/nsContentList.h", "dom/base/nsContentUtils.h"], "git_node": "0077791ed92d14cbfafa23cc9d581ebc49bf1044", "git_parents": ["af7734e70983100702e4bb09a93a3c26caac4882"], "node": "acbf2aeda810c88979666ceb350c2625ada7a7b5", "parents": ["727e88106bf51b5e9d034ee72d4e21912fc0aa28"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790021072, "git_changesets": ["0077791ed92d14cbfafa23cc9d581ebc49bf1044"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1714": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jonathan Moss \u003cjmoss@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070972 - Prevent loopback sink allocation queries from reaching imagefreeze  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327919\n", "files": ["testing/mochitest/runtests.py"], "git_node": "39fbf986a86a26898448a6db72d59df804eea9cb", "git_parents": ["0077791ed92d14cbfafa23cc9d581ebc49bf1044"], "node": "871099ad95f80006e5bbaaa52912c0eeea2f4157", "parents": ["acbf2aeda810c88979666ceb350c2625ada7a7b5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790059858, "git_changesets": ["39fbf986a86a26898448a6db72d59df804eea9cb"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1715": {"changesets": [{"author": "Julien Pages \u003cjpages@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072413 - wasm: Change rooting of throw-stub owner during an exception.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327156\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327821\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/tail-calls/bug2072413.js", "js/src/jit/JitFrames.cpp"], "git_node": "ac24c9a7f18d49e8359bc2f21ec56f3174cdd7ee", "git_parents": ["39fbf986a86a26898448a6db72d59df804eea9cb"], "node": "4c9b17832b61907976e90176d228b4e46d95316e", "parents": ["871099ad95f80006e5bbaaa52912c0eeea2f4157"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790074784, "git_changesets": ["ac24c9a7f18d49e8359bc2f21ec56f3174cdd7ee"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1716": {"changesets": [{"author": "Yury Delendik \u003cydelendik@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073266 - Recover the stack pointer after the import wrapper's call.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nThe wasm import wrapper reads its instance slot and runs its epilogue at\nframe-pointer-relative offsets computed from framePushed, which assumes the\nstack pointer is unchanged across the call. A callee that ends in a return\ncall collapses frames and can leave the stack pointer elsewhere, so restore\nit from the frame pointer before reading those slots.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327347\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327829\n", "files": ["js/src/wasm/WasmStubs.cpp"], "git_node": "e29ce2ec12c536ce21819e19fdbd9d322ab2ef69", "git_parents": ["ac24c9a7f18d49e8359bc2f21ec56f3174cdd7ee"], "node": "edd30df5ff5d86abaf2c717472a4b687e9942e3c", "parents": ["4c9b17832b61907976e90176d228b4e46d95316e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790074805, "git_changesets": ["e29ce2ec12c536ce21819e19fdbd9d322ab2ef69"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1717": {"changesets": [{"author": "Keith Cirkel \u003ckeithamus@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068340 - Plumb aFromParser through nsXMLContentSink  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nThis change ensures that nsXMLContentSink::HandleStartElement properly\npasses through the parser origin.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325403\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327779\n", "files": ["dom/xml/nsXMLContentSink.cpp", "dom/xml/nsXMLContentSink.h", "dom/xml/nsXMLFragmentContentSink.cpp"], "git_node": "ef5403453d3ed807b4615e093c6da0f391f7a479", "git_parents": ["e29ce2ec12c536ce21819e19fdbd9d322ab2ef69"], "node": "65bc46b475ce53862ceacf060e81ce5e25d5ea65", "parents": ["edd30df5ff5d86abaf2c717472a4b687e9942e3c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790074851, "git_changesets": ["ef5403453d3ed807b4615e093c6da0f391f7a479"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1718": {"changesets": [{"author": "Brad Werth \u003cbwerth@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068367: Make Cairo _get_bitmap_surface free its tmp buffer.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324784\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327865\n", "files": ["gfx/cairo/cairo/src/cairo-ft-font.c", "gfx/cairo/moz.yaml", "gfx/cairo/patches/0051-Bug-2068367-bitmap-surface-tmp-buffer.patch"], "git_node": "b4dee9e176a39635654c35d2c28d0dff70ca672d", "git_parents": ["ef5403453d3ed807b4615e093c6da0f391f7a479"], "node": "30b3497924301b1d52ac87b9792f356fd1b5e7bd", "parents": ["65bc46b475ce53862ceacf060e81ce5e25d5ea65"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790074889, "git_changesets": ["b4dee9e176a39635654c35d2c28d0dff70ca672d"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1719": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071069 - Update buffer calcs in nsStorageStream,  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327888\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327895\n", "files": ["xpcom/io/nsStorageStream.cpp"], "git_node": "6fed6a98fa2b24fe2dcb9bd3e7f13569ce24aeea", "git_parents": ["b4dee9e176a39635654c35d2c28d0dff70ca672d"], "node": "bd396a1cf6b78bbba84520688be5dc9118e6bf4f", "parents": ["30b3497924301b1d52ac87b9792f356fd1b5e7bd"], "tags": ["FIREFOX_140_17_0esr_BUILD1", "FIREFOX_140_17_0esr_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1790081018, "git_changesets": ["6fed6a98fa2b24fe2dcb9bd3e7f13569ce24aeea"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}}
